// 𝙄𝙉𝘿𝙄𝘾𝘼𝙏𝙊𝙍 𝘾𝘼𝙇𝘾𝙐𝙇𝘼𝙏𝙄𝙊𝙉𝙎
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------{
//@function Calculation of slope and intercept
//@param length LookBack Period
//@returns  Linear Regression Oscillator
linear_regression_osc(int length_xx)=>
    n      = length_xx
    sum_x  = 0.0
    sum_y  = 0.0
    sum_xy = 0.0
    sum_x_squared = 0.0

    for i = 0 to n - 1
        sum_x         := sum_x + i
        sum_y         := sum_y + source_xx[i]
        sum_xy        := sum_xy + i * source_xx[i]
        sum_x_squared := sum_x_squared + i * i

    m = (n * sum_xy - sum_x * sum_y) / (n * sum_x_squared - sum_x * sum_x)
    c = (sum_y - m * sum_x) / n
    
    linear_regression = ((m * bar_index + c)*-1)

// Calculate linear regression Oscillator
linear_regression = linear_regression_osc(length_xx)

// Normaliztion
linear_regression := (linear_regression - ta.sma(linear_regression, 100)) / ta.stdev(linear_regression, 100)

// Conditions of Mean Reversion and Trends
cond1  = ta.crossunder(linear_regression, 0)
cond2  = ta.crossover(linear_regression, 0)

// Separate conditions for mean reversion (boolean)
cond_1_bool = ta.crossunder(linear_regression, linear_regression[2]) and linear_regression > upper_xx
cond_2_bool = ta.crossover(linear_regression, linear_regression[2]) and linear_regression < lower_xx

// Values for plotting (preserve original values)
cond_1_value = cond_1_bool ? linear_regression[1] : na
cond_2_value = cond_2_bool ? linear_regression[1] : na

// Invalidation Price Levels 
